MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_001: Oh, Promised One! Er... Why are you looking at me\nlike that?
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_002: <NCA>"I heard you were wounded."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_003: <NCB>"Are you alright?"
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_004: <ACA>Oh no. They told you about that? I was trying not\nto worry you with it...
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_005: <ACB>Oh, yes! I'm OK. The nurses here are as skilled as\nthey come. I'm sorry if I worried you.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_006: <NCA>"I'm so glad you survived."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_007: Come on—there's no need for an army commander to\nworry about one measly soldier...
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_008: Please, focus on the victory ahead, not little\nold me.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_009: We won't be able to create the future Dagda deserves\nwithout you at your best.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_010: <NCA>"I'll make sure you see that future."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_011: Oh! As in...you won't let me fall? That's...so sweet.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_012: I agree, peace restored is meaningless without\nsomeone left to enjoy it.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_013: But I'm less concerned about me. As long as I can\nensure others get to see the future, I'm happy.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_014: I was born into a military family. And even though\nI'm the youngest, I'm just as trained as my siblings.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_015: It was my father's policy that all his children be\nprepared to take over the family business if needed.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_016: Since birth, I've been molded into a military expert.\nI'm probably better at war than working at Vandahl.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_017: So...that said, I have a suggestion. A request, really.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_018: You should move any non-militant members of your\nteam to the rear. I'll be returning to the front lines.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_019: <NCA>"Why? Do you mean to sacrifice yourself?"
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_020: No, silly, nothing like that at all.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_021: But I can't ignore the fact that even farmers and\nmerchants are being pulled into this fight.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_022: Talimun may be a demigod, but he's still just a\nmerchant, you know? He's not made for war like me.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_023: It warms me, honestly—knowing that even the\ncommon folk are ready to fight for what they believe.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_024: But at the end of the day, I think the battlefield...\nis a place for soldiers.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_025: I know moving your forces around might take some\ndoing, but I'd appreciate you trying anyway.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_026: <NCA>"Understood."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_027: <NCB>"I'll think about it."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_028: Thank you. And remember, I'm here for you\nhowever you need.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_A_029: I'm a Senghor, after all!
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_001: Please... Please! Let everything work out...
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_002: <NCA>"What are you praying for?"
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_003: Obviously I'm praying for the safety of the... WAIT!\nPromised One! Is...is it really you?
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_004: <NCA>"It was your prayers that saved me."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_005: <NCB>"Thank you for praying for me."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_006: <ACA>Oh, I didn't really do anything.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_007: <ACA>I was so worried, all I could do was pray... I wasn't\nsure it would work.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_008: <ACB>*sob* *sniffle* I wasn't sure my prayers would reach\nyou, but it was all I could do.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_009: <ACB>I've never be so grateful to be a believer.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_010: I was so surprised when you decided to \nstay behind!
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_011: *sob* I need to show my thanks for this miracle.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_012: <NCA>"It seems I have cause for thanks as well."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_013: <NCB>"I'm glad you're alive as well."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_014: Yeah... It wasn't easy, but I survived.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_015: I was prepared to die, even though there were still so\nmany things I wanted to do with my life.
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_016: But since we've been reunited...
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_017: Maybe you and I could do it all together?
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_018: First, I'll write everything that's happened to us into\na grand, heroic tale!
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_019: Then I want to drink teas of all kinds! And I'd like to\ncollect cute plates, and then...
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_020: <NCA>"Let's make all of that come true."
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_021: Oh, I'm so excited!
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_022: <RSDS>With you by my side, I know we can do anything and\neverything this world has to offer!
MID_SE_Ism_Lou_S_023: Promise me you'll be with me through it all, OK?